<title>ITALY: Italy budget summit due at 1330 GMT - source.</title>
<headline>Italy budget summit due at 1330 GMT - source.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Romano Prodi will meet leaders of parties which support his centre-left government for talks on the draft 1997 budget at 1330 GMT on Thursday, a political source said.</p>
<p>The meeting had been set for Wednesday but was postponed amid continued differences over the package with the hard left Communist Refoundation party. The cabinet is due to meet at 0800 GMT on Friday to discuss the budget.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +39 6 6782505</p>
</text>
